r-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flowering Meadows</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flora Laura</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">480$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decor</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"A great spot to put your flowers! Can be dyed with a Dye Machine.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Medium Vase</b> is a decoration item bought from <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a> for $480. The vase is a circular object that can be placed either way on the vertical axis. The mesh used for the vase has both the top and bottom exhibit a hole. The default color is a sandy-grey hue.\n</p><p>This vase, like its counterparts (<a href=\"/wiki/Small_Vase\" title=\"Small Vase\">Small Vase</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Large_Vase\" title=\"Large Vase\">Large Vase</a>) can be dyed using <a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">flowers</a>.\n</p><p>As of right now, players <i><u>cannot</u></i> put flowers in a vase. However, decoration using <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a> is possible. Make sure to anchor the vase first.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p>Players can obtain the Medium Vase by purchasing it with cash for $480 at Flora Laura, located in <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows.</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163417\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019441/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.501      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   44.501      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2782-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163417 and revision id 18818. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Flora Laura","exists":true},{"title":"Flowering Meadows","exists":true},{"title":"Flowers","exists":true},{"title":"Large Vase","exists":true},{"title":"Schematics","exists":true},{"title":"Small Vase","exists":true}],"images":["Medium_V